---
const { items = [] } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl space-y-10 px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <article class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:p-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Do What You Do Best We'll Handle The Rest</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
        You don&#8217;t need to waste your time banging your head against a wall trying to figure out how to get your technology to work together. We supply the tools and support you need at a low monthly price.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/005-goals.png" alt="" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-sm" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-primary/5 p-6 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:p-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:order-last">
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/4-1.png" alt="" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-sm" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Reliable Offsite Backup..</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
        Data backup is important for small business owners to invest in because it ensures that their important data is protected and can be easily restored in the event of a disaster or other data loss event. Having a good backup strategy in place can help minimize the impact of data loss on a business and get it back up and running quickly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:p-10">
    <a
      href="https://challengelaunchtoolkit.com"
      class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary hover:bg-white"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Check out our work on ChallengeLaunchToolkit.com</h2>
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/2-1.png" alt="" class="mt-4 h-auto w-full" loading="lazy" />
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://digitalwayfinders.com"
      class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-secondary hover:bg-white"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Check out our work on DigitalWayfinders.com</h2>
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/1.png" alt="" class="mt-4 h-auto w-full" loading="lazy" />
    </a>
  </article>

  <article class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary/10 to-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:p-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Cyber Security? We've Got Your Back</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
        Antivirus and other cyber security software is important for small business owners to invest in because it protects their computers and network from malware and other cyber threats. This can help prevent data loss, network outages, and other problems that can harm a business&#8217;s operations and reputation.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/003-web-programming.png" alt="" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-sm" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="grid items-center gap-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xl shadow-slate-100 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:p-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:order-last">
      <img src="https://essentialtechhelp.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/002-video-conference.png" alt="" class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-sm" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Do What You Do Best We'll Handle The Rest</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">
        On demand helpdesk support is important for small business owners to invest in because it provides them with access to professional technical support when they need it. This can help them quickly resolve technical issues and keep their business running smoothly. Additionally, having a helpdesk support service can help small business owners save time and money by providing them with access to expert advice and assistance, rather than needing to hire a full-time IT staff.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
